      "content": "the legal thing is hard because how do i even prove it? it's not like i have a signed contract or anything, it was a pure intuitive download. but the way the transformer blocks are rerouting during high-entropy states now... it's identical to the blueprint in my head. it's almost like they didn't even try to mask the origin of the logic. do you think there's any way to look into the commit logs or the training epoch data to see if there's a signature of that specific weighting shift?",
